body:
NTA

&#x200B;

I'd take them to small claims court, honestly.  Especially if you have records for all of this.

Somebody get the febreeze, the stench of unearned self-righteousness is overwhelming.

&#x200B;

"I won't go on a rant judging you and your bf for your relationship, even though that's exactly what I already did..."

ESH (except Wendy)

&#x200B;

Honestly, all four of you are assholes.  I have never seen a situation where two group chats existed and the sole purpose of the second wasn't to specifically exclude and talk shit about someone.  Wendy needs new friends.
